	(text "R_shunt = V_OUTmax_deviation/(gain*I_max)\n		= 1/(20*40) = 0.00125Ohm = 1.25mOhm\n1mOhm shunt resistor\n\nP=I^2*R = 40^2*(0.001) = 1.6W\nrated for more than 3W (margin)\n"
